 {k:'stop',label:'When should you pause or stop the test?',type:'textarea',why:'A stopping rule protects the learner and keeps the test appropriate.',how:'Include frustration, inaccessible directions, unsafe AI output, privacy concerns, or another condition that should end the test.',example:'Stop if the learner becomes frustrated, asks to stop, or cannot access the directions after one clarification.'}
